The '''Royal Palace of Zygerria''' was the primary residence of the [[Zygerrian]] [[Queen of Zygerria|monarch]]. During the [[Clone Wars]], it was the home of [[Queen]] [[Miraj Scintel]]. A towering edifice, the palace was [[Color|blue]] in color and dominated the [[Zygerria]]n [[capital]] city. It hosted a [[prison]] open for visitors like [[Gorga Desilijic Aarrpo]] to inspect potential [[Slavery|slaves]].<ref name="SotR" />

